@startuml state-task
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "JetBrains Mono"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam BorderColor #444444

title TaskState — Lifecycle Tâche — Apollia OS

[*] --> submitted : POST /api/v1/tasks\nou apollia-os run

submitted --> working : agent ACTIVE\nExecutionCoordinator dispatch

working --> completed : AIPResult.completed()
working --> failed : AIPResult.failed()\nou erreur non-récupérable
working --> input_required : AIPResult.input_required()\nHITL — approbation requise
working --> canceled : DELETE /api/v1/tasks/{id}\nou StepBudget timeout

input_required --> working : POST /api/v1/tasks/{id}/resume\n{ approved: true }
input_required --> failed : POST /api/v1/tasks/{id}/resume\n{ approved: false } → REJECTED
input_required --> canceled : TimeoutWatcher\n(> input_required_timeout, défaut 24h)

completed --> [*]
failed --> [*]
canceled --> [*]

note right of submitted
  Rejeté si agent :
  - INITIALIZING → SubmitError::NotReady
  - STOPPING/STOPPED → SubmitError::Unavailable
  - DEGRADED → accepté avec warning
end note

note right of working
  StepBudget surveillé en continu.
  BudgetExceeded → failed.
  ResilienceLayer actif.
end note

note right of input_required
  Tâche suspendue — oneshot channel ouvert.
  Prompt + context persistés en SQLite.
  NotificationEngine → desktop / webhook.
  TimeoutWatcher scan toutes les 60s.
end note

@enduml
